  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Take advantage of your opponents’ vulnerabilities and reposition yourself at the same time.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Improved Snap Shot<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When taking an attack of opportunity with your ranged weapon, you may take a 5 foot step as part of that attack. This does not count against the 5-foot step you can take during your turn. Additionally, by expending one use of your mythic power, you can reload your ranged weapon as an immediate action if you have a free hand.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-combat-a-m-feats#toc185\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
